.\" Title: vrunner-completions
.\" Author: vrunner contributors
.\" Manual section: 1
.\" Process this file with
.\"   groff -man -Tascii vrunner-completions.1

.TH VRUNNER-COMPLETIONS 1 "2026" "vrunner" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
vrunner completions \- generate shell completion scripts for vrunner

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vrunner completions
\fISHELL\fR

.SH DESCRIPTION
Generates a shell completion script for \fBvrunner\fR and writes it to
standard output. The script can be redirected to a file, sourced directly,
or installed to a system-wide completion directory.

Completions cover all vrunner subcommands (list, stop, spawn, freeze, thaw,
cert, screenshot, cat, resize, purge, config-check, completions),
global options (--config, --bind, --port, --remote, --tls, etc.),
and subcommand-specific flags.

.SH ARGUMENTS

.TP
.BR bash ", " zsh ", " fish ", " elvish ", " powershell
The shell to generate completions for. Case-insensitive.

.SH EXAMPLES

Generate and activate bash completions for the current session:
.RS
.PP
.nf
\fB$ vrunner completions bash > /tmp/vrunner.bash && source /tmp/vrunner.bash\fR
.fi
.RE

Install bash completions system-wide:
.RS
.PP
.nf
\fB$ vrunner completions bash > /etc/bash_completion.d/vrunner\fR
.fi
.RE

Install zsh completions:
.RS
.PP
.nf
\fB$ vrunner completions zsh > ~/.zsh/completions/_vrunner\fR
.fi
.RE

Install fish completions:
.RS
.PP
.nf
\fB$ vrunner completions fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/vrunner.fish\fR
.fi
.RE

Persist bash completions across sessions by adding to \fB~/.bashrc\fR:
.RS
.PP
.nf
\fB$ echo 'source /etc/bash_completion.d/vrunner' >> ~/.bashrc\fR
.fi
.RE

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vrunner (1),
.BR bash (1),
.BR zsh (1),
.BR fish (1)
